    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "More Actions — Import & Export Watch List",
      "id": "more-actions",
      "intro": "Tombol **More Actions** di toolbar utama membuka dialog penuh (full-screen drawer) bertajuk *More Actions* yang berisi dua tab: **Import List** dan **Export List**. Fitur ini digunakan untuk mengimpor atau mengekspor **identitas Watch List** (bukan nilainya/Watch Value) secara massal.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka More Actions Dialog",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **More Actions** di toolbar utama halaman Watch List (di antara tombol *Search* dan *Add List*).\n• Drawer *More Actions* akan terbuka dari sisi kanan layar dengan lebar besar (1200px).\n• Dialog ini memiliki ikon **⚙ Settings**, badge *Watch List*, dan subtitle *Additional operations for import and export watch list data*.\n• Terdapat dua tab: **Import List** (default aktif) dan **Export List**.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.15);border:1px solid #ede9fe;background:#fff;width:320px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #ede9fe;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#6d28d9);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">More Actions</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-top:1px;\">Additional operations for import and export watch list data</div></div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #c4b5fd;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">● Watch List</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;display:flex;gap:10px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#8b5cf6;border:1px solid #8b5cf6;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg>Import List</div><div style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>Export List</div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;text-align:center;color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;\">Tab content area — Import List or Export List</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Tab Import List — Impor Identitas Watch List",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Digunakan untuk mengimpor **identitas Watch List baru** (beserta field: List Name, Date From, Reason, dll.) dari file eksternal secara massal.\n• Area utama menampilkan **Dropzone** bertajuk **Acquire Source Manifest** — seret dan lepas file ke sana.\n• Format yang didukung: **CSV** (`.csv`) dan **JSON** (`.json`). Ukuran file maksimum: **25 MB**.\n• Setelah file di-drop, sistem menganalisis file dan menampilkan panel **Verification Center** berisi daftar Watch List yang terdeteksi (kolom: nomor urut + **List Name** / *Registry Entity*).\n• Pilih entri yang ingin diimport (atau klik **Select Visible** / **Reset All**), lalu klik **Finalize Import (n)**.\n\n> ⚠️ Ini berbeda dari *Import Watch Value* — fitur ini mengimpor **identitas/kulit** Watch List, bukan nilai individualnya.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:360px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#3b82f6;border-bottom:2px solid #3b82f6;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg>Import List</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Export List</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Import Watch List</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">Verify and ingest registry entries from external manifest files</div></div><div style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">⬆ Finalize Import</div></div><div style=\"border:2px dashed #3b82f6;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#1d4ed8);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 10px;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#1e3a8a;\">Acquire Source Manifest</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:4px;\">Drag & drop your CSV or JSON registry file here</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">.csv</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">.json</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Max 25MB</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Tab Export List — Ekspor Identitas Watch List",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Digunakan untuk mengekspor **identitas Watch List** yang terdaftar di sistem ke file CSV.\n• Tampilan terbagi dua panel:\n  - **Packaging Details** (sidebar kiri, 320px): menampilkan *Source Registries* (jumlah total), *Selection Target*, *Extraction Date*, dan *Export Protocol* (HTTPS / CSV).\n  - **Selection Source** (panel kanan): daftar seluruh Watch List dengan checkbox — kolom **Registry Entity** menampilkan List Name tiap-tiap entri.\n• Centang entri yang diinginkan (atau klik **Select All** / **Deselect All**), lalu klik **Finalize Export (n)**.\n• File hasil unduhan: `watch_list - [timestamp].csv` — tersimpan langsung ke folder unduhan lokal.\n\n> ⚠️ Ini berbeda dari *Export Watch Value* — file ini berisi **daftar Watch List** (header + identitasnya), bukan nilai-nilai di dalamnya.",
          "color": "#06b6d4",
          "bg": "#ecfeff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:360px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;\">Import List</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#06b6d4;border-bottom:2px solid #06b6d4;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>Export List</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Export Watch List</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">Package and extract selected registry entries into standardized manifests</div></div><div style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#06b6d4;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">↓ Finalize Export (2)</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:120px;min-width:120px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Packaging Details</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Source</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">12 Lists</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Selected</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#06b6d4;\">2</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Protocol</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">HTTPS/CSV</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#10b981;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#10b981;font-weight:600;\">Verified</span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">Registry Entity</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#06b6d4;\">Select All</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;background:#ecfeff;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#06b6d4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">High-Risk IP Addresses</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;background:#ecfeff;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#06b6d4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Trusted Corp BINs</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Blacklist Merchants</span></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
